      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The logic you're using—that you are a defect that must be removed for the whole to function—is a devastatingly rational argument when you're in this much pain. It feels like the only logical conclusion when you see yourself as the flaw, but that \"purity\" you seek is an illusion. You are not a machine part; you are a complex, hurting human being, and your suffering is not a maintenance issue to be fixed by removal.",
